---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Bo Kern" description="About Bo Kern Page">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<Hero
				title="About"
				tagline="Biotech, software, and the automation in between."
			>
				<img
					width="900"
					height="1200"
					src="/assets/p_holo.jpg"
					alt="Bo Kern looking though a holo lense"
				/>
			</Hero>

			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Background</h2>
				<div class="content">
			<p>
			I started programming early and never really stopped. In school I took
			computer science alongside the natural sciences, then studied Biotechnology
			at TU Berlin, treating them as one field rather than two. Through my
			Bachelor's and Master's I worked in lab automation and robotics research
			groups, applying software to lab problems. I make a living from it now, and I am nowhere near done.
			</p>
			<p>
			Today I work as a Field Applications Scientist at Biosero, embedded on a
			customer site where a large automated system is being built out: nine
			workcells, five to thirty devices each. I translate chemical and biological
			workflows into automated methods, write the C# and Python tooling that keeps
			runs recoverable, and train the scientists who use the system after I leave.
			</p>
			<p>
			I like problems that cross layers. A failing run might be a method issue, a
			driver issue, a network issue or a hardware issue, and I would rather find
			the root cause than route around it. That instinct carries over to what I
			build outside work: home infrastructure, embedded electronics, 3D-printed
			hardware and lighting and backend systems for events.
			</p>
				</div>
			</section>
<!-- 			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>Corporis voluptates tenetur laudantium.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Skills</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>officia unde omnis</p>
				</div>
			</section> -->
		</main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>
